    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yefuta na bana Efulaimu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū ba lūganda lwa ng'wa Efulaimu būkobya mabità gabo, hūna būkīla kūja Zafoni, būshika būng'wīla ū Yefuta gīkī, “Nibūlī waajile kwilwisha būlūgū na Baamoni ūleka ū kūtūlaalīka a bise ū kūja nang'ho? Tūkwītiima ī numba yako tūkūpembeele mumo nū bebe!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yefuta nang'hwe ūbashokeja ūhaya, “Ū nene na a banhū bane twalī mu wilwisha būtaale na a Baamoni, aho naang'witana kwiza kūnangūhīla, mutizile ū kūniguna ū mu makono gabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nahayūbona gīkī mutizaga ū kūnigunanha, niifunya būpanga wane kūcha na kūpīla, nūūkīla najile ko kwilwisha nabo a Baamoni; nang'hwe ū SEEBA ūninha būtindi nūbapyena. Hama hangī ī lelo ng'wiza kwilwiisha būlūgū naane kūlwa nguno kī?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Yefuta ūbitana a bana Gileadi, biza kwamba būlūgū kwilwisha na a banhū ba lūganda lwa Efulaimu; nguno bakandya kūbasondagūla a bana Gileadi balībahaya gīkī, “Angū nīyo a bing'we mulī mabūsoso dūhū ga kūponyiwa kūfuma mu lūganda lwa ng'wa ng'wa Efulaimu na lwa ng'wa Manase!” A bana Gileadi būbiza bapyeeni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna būja a ha mongo gwa Yolodani būūkadima a ha būkīlīlo wa kūja kū sī ya lūganda lwa ng'wa Efulaimu, a ba lūganda lwa ng'wa Efulaimu abo bakasaagīīla, būlī ng'wene ūlū wahayagīkī, “Bing'we nizunīlījagi nakīle,” a bana Gileadi bamūjaga, “Hamo ūlī wa lūganda lwa Efulaimu?” Ūlū ūhaya, “Mm yaya,” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bang'wīlaga, “Būgatū alihayaga ī gīkī, ‘Shiboleeti.’” Ūlū ūhaya “Siboleeti” kūlwa kūlemeelwa kūgūhaya ū mhayo gwenūyo ūmo gūlī, bandiimaga bamūlagīla a ha būkīlīlo wa Yolodani henaho. Ī likanza lyenīlo būbūlagwa banhū shihūmbī makūmi anè na shibīlī, ba kūfuma ū mu lūganda lwa ng'wa Efulaimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yefuta akabatongeela a Baisilaeli ikanza lya myaka ītandatū. Hūna ū Yefuta ū muna Gileadi ūcha, ūjīkwa mu nzengo gūmò gwa mu Gileadi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ībizani, Eloni, na Abudoni",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho wabīta ū ng'wenūyo, Ībizani wa Betelehemu ūbatongeela a Baisilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walī na bitūnja makūmi adatū na bashīke makūmi adatū; a bashīke bakwe akabafunya batoolwe na bagosha ba kūfuma mu ndūgū jingī. Na a bitūnja bakwe ūbatooja bakīma ba kūfuma mu ndūgū jingī najo. Ū Ībizani akabatongeela a Baisilaeli ikanza lya myaka mpungatī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hūna ūcha ū Ībizani, ūjīkwa mu Betelehemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho wabīta ū ng'wenūyo, Eloni wa lūganda lwa ng'wa Zabuloni ūbatongeela a Baisilaeli ikanza lya myaka ikūmi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ū Eloni ūcha, ūjīkwa mu nzengo gwa Aijaloni mu sī ya lūganda lwa ng'wa Zabuloni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wahayūbīta ū ng'wenūyo, Abudoni ng'witūnja o ng'wa Hileli wa kūfuma Pilasoni ūbatongeela a Baisilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walī na bitūnja makūmi anè, na bizūkūlū makūmi adatū; a bose baalī na ndamhī ja nzobe makūmi mpungatī. Nang'hwe ū ng'wenūyo akabatongeela a Baisilaeli ikanza lya myaka īnaane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Abudoni ng'witūnja o ng'wa Hileli ūcha, ūjīkīlwa Pilasoni mu sī ya ngūlū ja Baamaleki, ya lūganda lwa ng'wa Efulaimu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
